<section class="border-t border-line py-10"><h2 class="m-0 text-[18px] font-medium tracking-[-.02em]"><span lang="en">How we measure</span><span lang="ko">측정 방법</span></h2>
<ul class="mt-3 mb-0 grid max-w-[720px] list-disc gap-2 pl-5 text-[14px] text-muted">
<li><span lang="en">Every 5 minutes we send one unpaid request to the next routes in our index, the same request any client makes before paying. We never sign or pay.</span><span lang="ko">5분마다 색인의 다음 API들에 결제 없는 요청을 한 번씩 보냅니다. 어떤 클라이언트든 결제 전에 보내는 것과 같은 요청이고, 서명이나 결제는 하지 않습니다.</span></li>
<li><span lang="en">A check counts as up when the answer is HTTP 402 with a valid x402 quote. A route may legitimately answer differently to an empty request, so a low number is a signal to look closer and not a verdict.</span><span lang="ko">HTTP 402와 올바른 x402 견적이 오면 정상으로 셉니다. 빈 요청에 다르게 답하도록 만든 API도 있어서, 낮은 수치는 판정이 아니라 더 살펴볼 신호입니다.</span></li>
<li><span lang="en">One service gets at most one probe per hour. Latency uses successful checks from the last 7 days. Our own service is excluded.</span><span lang="ko">한 서비스는 1시간에 최대 한 번만 호출합니다. 응답 속도는 최근 7일의 성공한 측정만 씁니다. 우리 서비스는 측정에서 제외합니다.</span></li>
<li><span lang="en">Only our own measurements appear here: no third-party rankings, buyer counts or revenue.</span><span lang="ko">여기 나오는 값은 우리가 직접 잰 것뿐입니다. 제3자 순위, 구매자 수, 매출은 넣지 않습니다.</span></li>
<li><span lang="en">To have a service removed, or to report an error, write to <a class="text-ink underline decoration-line underline-offset-4" href="mailto:contact@1gateway.dev">contact@1gateway.dev</a>.</span><span lang="ko">서비스 제외 요청이나 오류 신고는 <a class="text-ink underline decoration-line underline-offset-4" href="mailto:contact@1gateway.dev">contact@1gateway.dev</a>로 보내 주세요.</span></li>
</ul></section></main>
<footer class="border-t border-line pt-6 pb-12 font-mono text-[11px] leading-normal tracking-[.02em] text-muted">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1040px] flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 px-4"><a class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sans text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink no-underline" href="/"><svg class="size-5 shrink-0 fill-current" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-gateway"/></svg>1gateway</a>
    <a class="text-muted hover:text-ink" href="/"><span lang="en">Home</span><span lang="ko">홈</span></a>
    <a class="text-muted hover:text-ink" href="/developers"><span lang="en">Developers</span><span lang="ko">개발자</span></a>
    <a class="text-muted hover:text-ink" href="/market"><span lang="en">Market</span><span lang="ko">마켓</span></a>
    <a class="text-muted hover:text-ink" href="/reports"><span lang="en">Reports</span><span lang="ko">리포트</span></a>
    <a class="text-muted hover:text-ink" href="mailto:contact@1gateway.dev">contact@1gateway.dev</a></div>
</footer>
<script>(function(){var r=document.documentElement;
document.getElementById("theme").addEventListener("click",function(){var d=r.getAttribute("data-theme")!=="dark";r.setAttribute("data-theme",d?"dark":"light");try{localStorage.setItem("1gw-theme",d?"dark":"light")}catch(e){}});
var lb=document.getElementById("lang-btn"),lm=document.getElementById("lang-menu"),li=[].slice.call(lm.querySelectorAll("[data-set-lang]"));
function setLang(l){l=l==="en"?"en":"ko";r.setAttribute("data-lang",l);r.setAttribute("lang",l);li.forEach(function(b){b.setAttribute("aria-checked",String(b.getAttribute("data-set-lang")===l))});try{localStorage.setItem("1gw-lang",l)}catch(e){}}
li.forEach(function(b){b.setAttribute("aria-checked",String(b.getAttribute("data-set-lang")===r.getAttribute("data-lang")))});
function openM(focus){lm.hidden=false;lb.setAttribute("aria-expanded","true");var c=lm.querySelector('[aria-checked="true"]')||li[0];if(focus)c.focus()}
function closeM(refocus){if(lm.hidden)return;lm.hidden=true;lb.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false");if(refocus)lb.focus()}
lb.addEventListener("click",function(){lm.hidden?openM(true):closeM(false)});
lb.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){if(e.key==="ArrowDown"||e.key==="ArrowUp"){e.preventDefault();openM(true)}});
lm.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){var i=li.indexOf(document.activeElement);if(e.key==="ArrowDown"){e.preventDefault();li[(i+1)%li.length].focus()}else if(e.key==="ArrowUp"){e.preventDefault();li[(i-1+li.length)%li.length].focus()}else if(e.key==="Home"){e.preventDefault();li[0].focus()}else if(e.key==="End"){e.preventDefault();li[li.length-1].focus()}else if(e.key==="Escape"){e.preventDefault();closeM(true)}else if(e.key==="Tab"){closeM(false)}});
li.forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener("click",function(){setLang(b.getAttribute("data-set-lang"));closeM(true)})});
document.addEventListener("pointerdown",function(e){if(!lm.hidden&&!e.target.closest("[data-picker]"))closeM(false)});

(function(){var b=document.getElementById("dev-btn"),m=document.getElementById("dev-menu");if(!b||!m)return;var items=[].slice.call(m.querySelectorAll("a"));
function open(f){m.hidden=false;b.setAttribute("aria-expanded","true");if(f)items[0].focus()}
function close(f){if(m.hidden)return;m.hidden=true;b.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false");if(f)b.focus()}
b.addEventListener("click",function(e){e.preventDefault();m.hidden?open(false):close(false)});
b.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){if(e.key==="ArrowDown"){e.preventDefault();open(true)}});
m.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){var i=items.indexOf(document.activeElement);if(e.key==="ArrowDown"){e.preventDefault();items[(i+1)%items.length].focus()}else if(e.key==="ArrowUp"){e.preventDefault();items[(i-1+items.length)%items.length].focus()}else if(e.key==="Escape"){e.preventDefault();close(true)}});
items.forEach(function(a){a.addEventListener("click",function(){close(false)})});
document.addEventListener("pointerdown",function(e){if(!m.hidden&&!e.target.closest("[data-dev-menu]"))close(false)});
document.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){if(e.key==="Escape")close(false)})})();

document.querySelectorAll('[data-list]').forEach(function(root){
var rows=[].slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('[data-list-row]')),q=root.querySelector('[data-list-q]'),chips=[].slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('[data-list-cat]')),nav=root.querySelector('[data-list-pager]'),pages=root.querySelector('[data-list-pages]'),empty=root.querySelector('[data-list-empty]'),status=root.querySelector('[data-list-status]'),cat='all',page=1,PER=+root.getAttribute('data-per')||5;
function apply(p){var words=q.value.toLowerCase().trim().split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean),matches=rows.filter(function(x){return(cat==='all'||x.getAttribute('data-cat')===cat)&&words.every(function(w){return(x.getAttribute('data-q')||'').indexOf(w)>=0})}),n=matches.length,P=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(n/PER)),total=rows.length,html='',last=0;page=Math.min(Math.max(1,p),P);rows.forEach(function(x){x.hidden=true});matches.slice((page-1)*PER,page*PER).forEach(function(x){x.hidden=false});empty.hidden=n>0;nav.hidden=P<2;var filtered=words.length>0||cat!=='all';root.querySelector('[data-list-empty-default]').hidden=filtered;root.querySelector('[data-list-empty-filtered]').hidden=!filtered;root.querySelector('[data-list-reset]').hidden=!filtered;
status.innerHTML='<span lang="en">'+(n===total?n:n+' of '+total)+' '+root.getAttribute('data-unit-en')+(P>1?' · page '+page+'/'+P:'')+'</span><span lang="ko">'+(n===total?n:total+'개 중 '+n)+root.getAttribute('data-unit-ko')+(P>1?' · '+page+'/'+P+' 페이지':'')+'</span>';
nav.querySelector('[data-list-page="prev"]').disabled=page<2;nav.querySelector('[data-list-page="next"]').disabled=page>=P;
for(var k=1;k<=P;k++)if(k===1||k===P||Math.abs(k-page)<2){if(k-last>1)html+='<span class="px-1 font-mono text-[12px] text-muted" aria-hidden="true">…</span>';html+='<button type="button" data-list-page="'+k+'" class="inline-grid h-7 min-w-7 cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-ctl border border-transparent bg-transparent px-1.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-muted transition-colors duration-[120ms] ease-aw hover:bg-soft hover:text-ink disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-40 aria-[current=page]:border-line aria-[current=page]:text-ink"'+(k===page?' aria-current="page"':'')+'>'+k+'</button>';last=k}pages.innerHTML=html}
function setCat(c){cat=c;chips.forEach(function(b){b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b.getAttribute('data-list-cat')===c))});apply(1)}
function ph(){q.placeholder=q.getAttribute('data-ph-'+document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-lang'))||''}ph();new MutationObserver(ph).observe(document.documentElement,{attributes:true,attributeFilter:['data-lang']});
q.addEventListener('input',function(){apply(1)});q.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){if(e.key==='Escape'&&q.value){e.preventDefault();q.value='';apply(1)}});chips.forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){setCat(b.getAttribute('data-list-cat'))})});nav.addEventListener('click',function(e){var b=e.target.closest('[data-list-page]');if(!b||b.disabled)return;var v=b.getAttribute('data-list-page');apply(v==='prev'?page-1:v==='next'?page+1:+v);if(root.getBoundingClientRect().top<0)root.scrollIntoView({block:'start'})});root.querySelector('[data-list-reset]').addEventListener('click',function(){q.value='';setCat('all');q.focus()});apply(1);
});
})();</script>
</body>
</html>